    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras/c42b635e95fc46fe227caae7e11874f9.avif?t=1755177125\" data-has-big width=800 height=75 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Kimono Cats</strong>, a delightful, festival-themed journey where every popped bubble leads to surprises! Set in a vibrant interpretation of old Japan, you\u2019ll join two adorable cats dressed in colorful kimonos on a quest to create the most charming village imaginable.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras/a5488b8ea6afd2cd89cea0a239b099ba.avif?t=1755177125\" data-has-big width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of casual, social, and lighthearted games, Kimono Cats combines stress-free bubble-popping with cooperative community features, ensuring you\u2019ll always have something fun to do \u2013 and someone to share it with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>18 total levels</strong>, <strong>18 mini-games</strong>, and over <strong>112 types of bubbles</strong> to pop, there\u2019s always something fresh to experience. Are you ready to master carnival-inspired challenges, unlock fun decorations, and see your feline friends grow happier with every play session?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras/f167d430a6cc019339d50fb909a5c3b0.avif?t=1755177125\" data-has-big width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw darts at floating bubbles and watch the festival road transform before your eyes. Different bubble types reveal coins, helpful items, or whimsical twists like sudden weather changes and cameo characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras/e1b6191347447f0681171cdf1cdda233.avif?t=1755177125\" data-has-big width=800 height=790 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras/534066859795403df0aa16f3f4516e4f.avif?t=1755177125\" data-has-big width=800 height=91 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the coins you earn to decorate and expand your village. Choose from various items \u2013 houses, shops, decorations, plants, and more \u2013to craft a unique environment that reflects your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras/7223a40e8e8d0c1f5bcc21652603779c.avif?t=1755177125\" data-has-big width=800 height=91 /></span>Swap gifts, drop kind messages, and visit other players\u2019 villages to spark joy and collaboration: no raiding or stealing \u2013 just a warm, supportive community to be part of.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras/cd1f21044e9587e19c2d00604e314405.avif?t=1755177125\" data-has-big width=800 height=91 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from popping bubbles to enjoy festival-inspired mini-games. Try your hand at goldfish scooping, music/rhythm challenges, ball tosses, shuriken throwing, and more. Earn hearts and coins while having a blast!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras/ca9bf0a729ff291c47ce9dbedd4e0fe0.avif?t=1755177125\" data-has-big width=800 height=91 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from a variety of cat avatars and customize them with outfits and accessories. Grow closer to your feline friend by feeding them treats and unlocking adorable animations\u2014like hugging, dancing, and playful interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras/2341bf27237f901f3e8fef778fb44840.avif?t=1755177125\" data-has-big width=800 height=91 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a relaxed, welcoming atmosphere with flexible relationship options and a gentle romance/happiness system. Kimono Cats celebrates acceptance, creativity, and positive social interaction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras/388d90e962fa0c094c55c29832f8dbb8.avif?t=1755177125\" data-has-big width=800 height=91 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new festival roads, mini-games, and cultural backdrops as you level up. Expect to find hidden events, cameo characters, and new decorative collectibles that keep the festival spirit alive!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>18 Levels</strong> to Explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>18 Mini-Games</strong> for Extra Fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>112 Types of Bubbles</strong> (From Weather Effects to Coin Boosts)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>227 Village Items</strong> to Decorate (81 Decorations, 31 Plants, 60 Houses, 15 Terrain Pieces, 18 Stores, 22 Outfits)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>26 Playable Cat Avatars</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 Types of Candy-Jar Gacha with 7 Unique Item Categories</strong> (Decorations, Plants, Houses, Terrain, Stores, Outfits, Cards)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positive Social Features</strong> (Gift-Giving, Visiting Others\u2019 Villages, Supportive Community)</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras/c42b635e95fc46fe227caae7e11874f9.avif?t=1755177125\" data-has-big width=800 height=75 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Kimono Cats</strong>, a delightful, festival-themed journey where every popped bubble leads to surprises! Set in a vibrant interpretation of old Japan, you\u2019ll join two adorable cats dressed in colorful kimonos on a quest to create the most charming village imaginable.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras/a5488b8ea6afd2cd89cea0a239b099ba.avif?t=1755177125\" data-has-big width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of casual, social, and lighthearted games, Kimono Cats combines stress-free bubble-popping with cooperative community features, ensuring you\u2019ll always have something fun to do \u2013 and someone to share it with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>18 total levels</strong>, <strong>18 mini-games</strong>, and over <strong>112 types of bubbles</strong> to pop, there\u2019s always something fresh to experience. Are you ready to master carnival-inspired challenges, unlock fun decorations, and see your feline friends grow happier with every play session?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras/f167d430a6cc019339d50fb909a5c3b0.avif?t=1755177125\" data-has-big width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw darts at floating bubbles and watch the festival road transform before your eyes. Different bubble types reveal coins, he